sult({\"processed\": 50, \"failed\": 10})\nraise ExecutionError(\"Batch processing completed with errors\")\n```\n\n**Rule: Only use try-except in actions for strategic error collection (continuing despite errors). For all other cases, let errors raise naturally.**\n\n",
